alyst publishes (/Catalyst/<name>/â€¦): state, position against goal, velocity, current, temperature, at-goal; and the swerve modules, actual against commanded.␀␀get_power␀␀␀Battery voltage, brownout floor and prediction, total current, and the power distribution channels with what each feeds and its live current if the robot publishes the PDH.␀␀␀␀get_can␀CAN devices grouped by bus with their connected state, each bus's utilization, bus-down flags and the device roster's expected/connected counts.␀␀␀␀get_vision␀␀Vision health: level, each camera's state, frame rate and temperature, and the tag in view.␀run_preflight␀␀␀Runs the tablet's preflight: listens to the robot for about 3 seconds, then returns GO or NO-GO with every failure and warning. Changes nothing.␀␀␀␀list_topics␀Lists NetworkTables topic names and types under a prefix (e.g. "/Catalyst/Elevator/"). At most 200 names.␀␀␀{"type":"object","properties":{"prefix":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":120}},"required":["prefix"],"additionalProperties":false}␀␀␀␀read_topics␀Reads the current values of up to 40 NetworkTables topics by full name.␀{"type":"object","properties":{"names":{"type":"array","minItems":1,"maxItems":40,"items":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":160}}},"required":["names"],"additionalProperties":false}␀␀list_tunables␀␀␀The tunables the robot declares (/Catalyst/Tunables/.manifest): key, name, group, unit, range, step and current value. Only these can be changed.␀␀␀list_autos␀␀The auto chooser's options, the selected one and the active one.␀␀␀␀list_snapshots␀␀Snapshots of every tunable taken before each change the tablet made, newest first, with what differs from the robot now.␀␀␀␀list_logs␀␀␀Driver Station and robot logs on the tablet's microSD card (.wpilog, .dslog, .dsevents).␀␀␀␀summarize_log␀␀␀Summarizes one log from list_logs: duration, lowest battery, brownouts and voltage dips, trip time, packet loss, CAN and CPU peaks, and the first events.␀␀␀{"type":"object","properties":{"name":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":120}},"required":["name"],"additionalProperties":false}␀␀␀␀systemcore_health␀␀␀Systemcore's own view from catalyst-agent (port 9010): OS and uptime, per-core CPU and throttling, temperatures, memory, storage, top processes, CAN interface error counters, network, and the robot program's service state, restarts and log tail. Systemcore only.␀␀motor_history␀␀␀The robot's motor history (FrcCatalyst MotorHistory via catalyst-agent): the most worn motors by running time, heat and faults. Systemcore only.␀␀␀␀code_tree␀␀␀Lists files in the robot project on the PC, relative to the repo root.␀␀{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string","maxLength":200},"depth":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":4}},"additionalProperties":false}␀␀␀code_read␀␀␀Reads lines of a file in the robot project (at most 400 lines per call).␀␀␀␀{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":200},"start":{"type":"integer","minimum":1},"end":{"type":"integer","minimum":1}},"required":["path"],"additionalProperties":false}␀␀␀␀code_search␀Searches the robot project for a plain substring (case-insensitive).␀␀␀␀{"type":"object","properties":{"query":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":120},"path":{"type":"string","maxLength":200}},"required":["query"],"additionalProperties":false}␀list_patches␀␀␀␀Patch branches proposed from the tablet and their status (proposed, merged, dropped).␀␀␀list_work_orders␀␀␀␀Work orders in the PC's inbox.␀␀{"type":"object","properties":{"status":{"type":"string","enum":["open","claimed","done","rejected","all"]}},"additionalProperties":false}␀␀Changes one declared tunable. The technician must approve it on screen; every tunable is snapshotted first so it can be reverted. Returns the value the robot echoes back.␀␀{"type":"object","properties":{"key":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":96,"description":"the tunable's full NT key from list_tunables"},"value":{"type":["number","boolean"]},"reason":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":240}},"required":["key","value","reason"],"additionalProperties":false}␀␀Selects an autonomous routine in the chooser (one of list_autos' options). Needs the technician's approval.␀{"type":"object","properties":{"name":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":40},"reason":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":240}},"required":["name","reason"],"additionalProperties":false}␀␀␀revert_snapshot␀Writes a snapshot's tunable values back to the robot. Needs the technician's approval; the current values are snapshotted first.␀␀␀␀{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"integer","minimum":1},"reason":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":240}},"required":["id","reason"],"additionalProperties":false}␀␀␀Proposes a change to the robot's code. After the technician approves, Catalyst Link commits it on a new branch in its own worktree on the PC: never the checked-out branch, never pushed, never deployed. Each edit replaces `old`, which must occur exactly once in the file, with `new`; old "" with a new path creates a file. Returns the branch, diffstat and compile check.␀␀␀{"type":"object","properties":{"title":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":80},"summary":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":2000},"edits":{"type":"array","minItems":1,"maxItems":20,"items":{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":200},"old":{"type":"string","maxLength":20000},"new":{"type":"string","maxLength":20000}},"required":["path","old","new"],"additionalProperties":false}}},"required":["title","summary","edits"],"additionalProperties":false}␀create_work_order␀␀␀Drops a work order in Catalyst Link's inbox for the PC's own agent to work on later. Attach a proposed patch's id and files from the tablet's microSD (recordings, clips, logs; paths relative to the card). Queued on the tablet if the PC is unreachable.␀{"type":"object","properties":{"title":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":96},"body":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":8000},"kind":{"type":"string","enum":["bug","task","tune","question"]},"priority":{"type":"string","enum":["low","normal","high"]},"patch":{"type":"string","maxLength":80},"sd_files":{"type":"array","maxItems":8,"items":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":160}}},"required":["title","body","kind","priority"],"additionalProperties":false}␀␀␀..␀␀.git␀␀␀␀%.*s%s␀␀ (+%d lines)␀␀␀␀tried␀␀␀note␀␀␀␀No NetworkTables connection to the robot: nothing live to read. Check the radio or tether, that the robot is on, and the team number in settings.␀␀␀%ld␀{"error":"no microSD card"}␀%s/logs␀logs/␀␀␀,%ld]␀␀␀[name, bytes]␀␀␀%d logs␀open␀␀␀␀Catalyst Link doesn't take the tablet's token (check it in settings)␀␀␀␀Catalyst Link on the PC isn't reachable␀Catalyst Link isn't set up␀␀ (refused)␀␀depth␀␀␀/code/tree?path=%s&depth=%d␀tree of %s␀␀/code/read?path=%s&start=%d&end=%d␀␀%s:%dâ€“%d␀␀query␀␀␀/code/search?q=%s&path=%s&max=40␀␀␀␀search "%s"␀/inbox?status=%s␀␀␀␀The code lives on the PC; start catalyst_link.py there, or set its address in settings.␀Catalyst Link unreachable␀␀␀â€¦(truncated: ask for less)␀␀␀␀names␀␀␀age_s␀␀␀string[]␀␀␀␀"(binary)"␀␀%d of %d topics␀sd_files␀␀␀␀{"error":"sd_files[%d]: give a path relative to the microSD card, no '..'"}␀bad file path␀␀␀{"error":"no such file on the card: %s"}␀␀␀␀no file %s␀␀{"error":"couldn't send or queue %s"}␀␀␀couldn't attach %s␀␀{"title":␀␀␀,"body":␀␀␀␀body␀␀␀␀,"kind":␀␀␀␀kind␀␀␀␀,"priority":␀␀␀␀priority␀␀␀␀,"patch":␀␀␀,"files":␀␀␀,"robot":␀␀␀,"from":"catalyst-tab"}␀/inbox␀␀{"ok":true␀␀In the PC's inbox; its agent works through it asynchronously.␀␀␀sent: %s␀␀␀␀{"status":%d,"link_said":␀␀␀refused by the Link (%d)␀␀␀␀queued␀␀Work order queued on microSD: it goes to the PC when Catalyst Link is back.␀Catalyst Link is unreachable and the work order couldn't be queued (no microSD?).␀␀␀not sent␀␀␀␀%s: %s␀␀Catalyst Link is unreachable: the work order waits on the 